<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

<title>BANGO V9 | Football + Daily Lotto</title>

<style>

*{
    box-sizing:border-box;
}

body{
    margin:0;
    font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;
    background:#070b12;
    color:#ffffff;
}

header{
    text-align:center;
    padding:25px 15px;
    background:linear-gradient(135deg,#111827,#020617);
    border-bottom:1px solid #273244;
}

header h1{
    margin:0;
    font-size:32px;
}

header p{
    color:#94a3b8;
    margin:8px 0 15px;
}

.status{
    display:flex;
    justify-content:center;
    flex-wrap:wrap;
    gap:8px;
}

.status span{
    background:#182231;
    padding:8px 12px;
    border-radius:20px;
    font-size:12px;
}

.green{
    color:#4ade80;
}

.yellow{
    color:#facc15;
}

.red{
    color:#f87171;
}

nav{
    display:flex;
    overflow-x:auto;
    background:#0c111b;
    border-bottom:1px solid #273244;
}

nav button{
    flex:1;
    min-width:120px;
    padding:16px 10px;
    border:0;
    background:none;
    color:#94a3b8;
    font-weight:bold;
    cursor:pointer;
}

nav button.active{
    color:white;
    background:#1d2939;
}

main{
    max-width:1200px;
    margin:auto;
    padding:15px;
}

.section{
    display:none;
}

.section.active{
    display:block;
}

.title{
    margin:10px 0 16px;
}

.grid{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(280px,1fr));
    gap:15px;
}

.card{
    background:#111827;
    border:1px solid #273449;
    border-radius:15px;
    padding:17px;
    margin-bottom:15px;
}

.card h3{
    margin-top:0;
}

.league{
    color:#94a3b8;
    font-size:12px;
}

.match-top{
    display:flex;
    justify-content:space-between;
    align-items:center;
    margin-bottom:12px;
}

.live{
    color:#f87171;
    font-weight:bold;
}

.time{
    color:#facc15;
    font-weight:bold;
}

.teams{
    font-size:18px;
    font-weight:bold;
    line-height:2;
}

.score{
    float:right;
    font-size:25px;
}

.row{
    display:flex;
    justify-content:space-between;
    padding:7px 0;
    color:#cbd5e1;
}

.prediction{
    margin-top:12px;
    padding-top:12px;
    border-top:1px solid #273449;
}

.signal{
    margin-top:13px;
    padding:11px;
    border-radius:10px;
    background:#10251a;
    color:#4ade80;
    text-align:center;
    font-weight:bold;
}

.value{
    margin-top:10px;
    padding:10px;
    border-radius:10px;
    background:#29200c;
    color:#facc15;
}

.action{
    width:100%;
    padding:13px;
    margin-top:12px;
    border:0;
    border-radius:10px;
    background:#2563eb;
    color:white;
    font-weight:bold;
    cursor:pointer;
}

.action:hover{
    background:#1d4ed8;
}

.note{
    background:#131d2b;
    border-left:4px solid #2563eb;
    padding:13px;
    border-radius:8px;
    color:#cbd5e1;
    line-height:1.5;
    margin-bottom:15px;
}

.lotto{
    text-align:center;
}

.ball{
    display:inline-flex;
    justify-content:center;
    align-items:center;
    width:45px;
    height:45px;
    border-radius:50%;
    background:#2563eb;
    margin:5px;
    font-weight:bold;
    font-size:16px;
}

.stats{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);
    gap:10px;
    margin-top:18px;
}

.stat{
    background:#0a1019;
    border:1px solid #273449;
    padding:13px;
    border-radius:10px;
    color:#94a3b8;
}

.stat strong{
    display:block;
    color:white;
    font-size:21px;
    margin-top:5px;
}

.pick{
    margin-top:18px;
    padding:15px;
    background:#0b111b;
    border-radius:10px;
    border:1px solid #273449;
}

.empty{
    text-align:center;
    color:#94a3b8;
    padding:30px;
}

footer{
    text-align:center;
    padding:30px 15px;
    color:#64748b;
    font-size:12px;
}

@media(max-width:600px){

    header h1{
        font-size:25px;
    }

    main{
        padding:12px;
    }

    .stats{
        grid-template-columns:1fr;
    }

}

</style>
</head>


<body>


<header>

<h1>🔥 BANGO V9</h1>

<p>Football Intelligence + Daily Lotto</p>

<div class="status">

<span>
⚽ Football
<b class="green">● READY</b>
</span>

<span>
🎯 Daily Lotto
<b class="green">● READY</b>
</span>

<span>
🧠 BANGO V9
<b class="green">● ACTIVE</b>
</span>

</div>

</header>


<nav>

<button class="active" onclick="openTab('football',this)">
⚽ FOOTBALL
</button>

<button onclick="openTab('live',this)">
🔴 LIVE
</button>

<button onclick="openTab('lotto',this)">
🎯 DAILY LOTTO
</button>

<button onclick="openTab('analysis',this)">
📊 ANALYSIS
</button>

</nav>


<main>


<!-- FOOTBALL -->

<section id="football" class="section active">

<h2 class="title">⚽ Today's Football</h2>

<div class="note">

BANGO V9 analyses football matches using form,
goals, home/away performance and probability.

